{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"media","input":{"id":69293,"type":"tv"},"checkedAt":1793641685670,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"source":"tmdb-api","id":69293,"type":"tv","sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69293","fetchedAt":"2026-11-02T17:48:05.670Z","originalLanguage":"ja-JP","title":{"value":"Little Witch Academia","language":"it-IT"},"originalTitle":"リトルウィッチアカデミア","overview":{"value":"Affascinata fin dall'infanzia dagli spettacoli della strega Shiny Chariot, l'ordinaria Atsuko \"Akko\" Kagari si iscrive alla prestigiosa accademia di magia Luna Nova. Pur priva di retaggio magico e poco incline alle rigide lezioni tradizionali, Akko non rinuncia al proprio sogno. Il ritrovamento della leggendaria Shiny Rod permetterà alla giovane strega di affrontare inaspettate minacce e proteggere la scuola.","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"A believing heart is your magic.","language":"en-US"},"startDate":"2017-01-09","endDate":"2017-06-26","status":"Ended","rating":7.926,"ratingCount":176,"numberOfEpisodes":25,"numberOfSeasons":1,"genres":["Animazione","Sci-Fi & Fantasy","Commedia","Action & Adventure","Kids"],"countries":["Japan"],"facts":{"Runtime":"24m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[{"id":614,"name":"TOKYO MX","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hSdroyVthq3CynxTIIY7lnS8w1.png"}],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":1164931,"name":"Megumi Han","role":"Atsuko \"Akko\" Kagari (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cwnwrPg1YvB19TbfouC4ShGPmbQ.jpg"},{"id":1164932,"name":"Michiyo Murase","role":"Sucy Manbavaran (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gL3D3SzEE8r2ywI4GIxkD7QxCKu.jpg"},{"id":23988,"name":"Fumiko Orikasa","role":"Lotte Yanson (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f5d1J13fksa1hK8u7AS95aO8b9.jpg"},{"id":1296666,"name":"Chinatsu Akasaki","role":"Barbara Parker (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nYYs30FgGrgr3uOiQ4ASmRpFca2.jpg"},{"id":1072774,"name":"Yoko Hikasa","role":"Diana Cavendish (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mP3bj0s1gqJ6tCKFLhu4b1CkJj7.jpg"},{"id":55662,"name":"Noriko Hidaka","role":"Ursula Callistis (voice) / Shiny Chariot (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/43OuwsjqGf7JxpFpUvB75OdDDXQ.jpg"},{"id":1491179,"name":"Arisa Shida","role":"Amanda O'Neill (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pkFz4v2WqIPBBP056PXjnlKScsv.jpg"},{"id":2676600,"name":"Ryosuke Kanemoto","role":"Andrew Hanbridge (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/340RBG12jZE0xjIKJY0flAXXtx5.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Little Witch Academia","overview":"Affascinata fin dall'infanzia dagli spettacoli della strega Shiny Chariot, l'ordinaria Atsuko \"Akko\" Kagari si iscrive alla prestigiosa accademia di magia Luna Nova. Pur priva di retaggio magico e poco incline alle rigide lezioni tradizionali, Akko non rinuncia al proprio sogno. Il ritrovamento della leggendaria Shiny Rod permetterà alla giovane strega di affrontare inaspettate minacce e proteggere la scuola."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Little Witch Academia","overview":"When she was a little girl, Atsuko \"Akko\" Kagari saw a magic show performed by a witch named Shiny Chariot.  From that day on she wanted to be just like her.  Enrolling at Luna Nova Magical Academy and having no magical background, can she become a witch like her idol Shiny Chariot?","tagline":"A believing heart is your magic."},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"幼い頃に見た魔法ショーで魔法の魅力に取り憑かれ、ヨーロッパの魔女育成名門校「ルーナノヴァ魔法学校」に入学したアッコ。大きな期待とは裏腹に日々の授業は意外と退屈。保守的な魔法界の雰囲気を打ち破り、魔法に夢を取り戻そうと張り切るアッコだが、周囲の目は冷ややかで授業でも空回りの連続。唯一の味方はルームメイトで親友のロッテとスーシィの２人だけ。そんなある日、学校でとんでもないハプニングが発生。思いがけず事件解決の鍵を握ってしまったアッコは、ロッテ、スーシィ達と共に学校崩壊の危機に立ち向かう！","tagline":"言の葉・グラントリスケル・シャリオの過去 運命が今、動き出すーー！！"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aRFsPTh6bK2t0hJYQoTBcdhylMs.png","previewUrl":"https